# Modules Directory

This directory contains individual analysis modules of the framework.

## Available Modules

| Module | Description | Status |
|--------|-------------|--------|
| [`geomechanics_1d_mem/`](geomechanics_1d_mem/) | 1D Mechanical Earth Model | ✅ v1.0 |
| `subsidence_analysis/` | Land subsidence analysis | 🚧 Coming Soon |
| `reservoir_geomechanics/` | 3D reservoir geomechanics | 📋 Planned |
| `well_stability_3d/` | 3D wellbore stability | 📋 Planned |

## Module Structure

Each module follows a consistent structure:
module_name/
├── README.md Module documentation
├── src/ Source code
│ ├── init.py
│ ├── config.py Module configuration
│ ├── data_loader.py Data loading utilities
│ ├── calculations.py Core calculations
│ ├── visualization.py Plotting functions
│ └── main.py Main entry point
├── data/
│ └── sample/ Module-specific sample data
├── notebooks/ Example Jupyter notebooks
└── docs/ Module documentation
